<view class="page">
<view class="eyebrow">MY GREEN DAYS</view><view class="title">享受挥杆，也享受生活</view><view class="card row space"><view class="avatar" style="width:112rpx;height:112rpx;font-size:44rpx">{{profile.name[0]}}</view><view class="grow"><view style="font-size:36rpx;font-weight:600">{{profile.name}}</view><view class="muted">{{profile.goal}}</view></view><text class="link" bindtap="edit">编辑</text></view><view class="metrics"><view class="metric"><text class="num">{{stats.rounds}}</text><text class="label">打球轮数</text></view><view class="metric"><text class="num">{{friends}}</text><text class="label">常用球友</text></view><view class="metric"><text class="num">{{stats.best}}</text><text class="label">最佳 18 洞</text></view></view><view class="card"><view class="menu row" bindtap="friends"><text>球友管理</text><text>›</text></view><view class="menu row" bindtap="history"><text>我的打球记录</text><text>›</text></view><view class="menu row" bindtap="stats"><text>数据统计</text><text>›</text></view><view class="menu row" bindtap="exportData"><text>导出本地数据备份</text><text>↓</text></view><view class="menu row" bindtap="showImport"><text>从备份恢复</text><text>↑</text></view><view class="menu row" bindtap="about"><text>关于青野 / 使用说明</text><text>›</text></view></view><view wx:if="importing" class="card"><view class="sub">粘贴备份 JSON。恢复将覆盖本机数据，请先导出备份。</view><textarea class="space" maxlength="-1" bindinput="backupInput" placeholder="粘贴备份内容"/><view class="row space"><button class="grow" bindtap="showImport">取消</button><button class="primary grow" bindtap="restore">恢复备份</button></view></view><view wx:if="exportPath" class="card"><view class="sub">备份已写入本机文件，可复制内容保存在手机备忘录；也可通过微信分享文件。</view><button class="space" bindtap="shareBackup">分享备份文件</button><button class="space" bindtap="copyBackup">复制备份内容</button></view><view class="footer-note">青野 GOLF · V3.1<view/>数据仅存于当前设备，请定期备份</view>
</view>
